{"data":[{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1746488503599550830","created_at":"2024-01-14T11:04:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746488503599550830"],"id":"1746488503599550830","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3331,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"又疼上了\n你妈个逼的\n洗了算了","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746488503599550830"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1746462670289822061","created_at":"2024-01-14T09:22:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746462670289822061"],"id":"1746462670289822061","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3400,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"睁眼第一顿是br的俩冰淇淋球\n别管我了\n人不会轻易死掉的","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746462670289822061"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1746386230143864996","created_at":"2024-01-14T04:18:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746386230143864996"],"id":"1746386230143864996","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3291,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我靠\n有点严重了\n我一晚上腰疼醒两次\n这会儿也是疼醒的\n现在疼的坐不住\n莫非真的要早点回家了\n主要是这俩月你妈的没交保险\n看病没法在这报销啊\n我他妈真的很抠门","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746386230143864996"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1746259375440990325","created_at":"2024-01-13T19:54:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746259375440990325"],"id":"1746259375440990325","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3504,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"刚刚看了一下账单\n说起来有点恐怖\n我一个星期花了8k左右\n其实主要是买了一块表和一个耳机这就6k了\n这是能看得着的东西算是大头\n那么问题来了\n剩下的2k 花去哪里了\n我每天点一顿外卖吃两顿\n看病也才花了200\n我的钱\n到底\n去哪里了？？？？？？\n回国要带的东西还都没买\n钱呢？\n我还想买衣服呢\n钱呢？？？","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746259375440990325"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","conversation_id":"1746082160610857105","created_at":"2